{"seq":2,"slug":"per-tool-otel-export-config","title":"三家 CLI 的 OTel export 配置","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/observability/otel-fundamentals/per-tool-otel-export-config","wordCount":987,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"三家-cli-的-otel-export-配置\">三家 CLI 的 OTel export 配置</h1><p>OTel 协议本体讲完，下一步是把三家工具配起来：env var 怎么设、exporter 怎么选、admin 怎么中央化、cloud 模式怎么处理。本文按 Claude Code / Codex CLI / Gemini CLI 三家依次过一遍，再讲跨工具 unified export 的部署模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三家 CLI 的 OTel 启用都走 <strong>opt-in env var + OTLP exporter</strong> 两层。差别在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>谁默认配好 dashboard</strong>：Gemini 与 Dynatrace 深度集成、Claude 与 Codex 不绑定 backend</li>\n<li><strong>admin 怎么中央化</strong>：Claude 用 <code>managed-settings.json</code>、Codex 用 cloud-managed config、Gemini 用 gcloud config</li>\n<li><strong>cloud 模式自动 export</strong>：Codex Cloud 与 Anthropic 自管 exporter、本地装机要手动配</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Claude Code] --&gt; X[OTLP HTTP/gRPC]&#10;    B[Codex CLI] --&gt; X&#10;    C[Gemini CLI] --&gt; X&#10;    X --&gt; Y[OTel Collector]&#10;    Y --&gt; Z1[Prometheus]&#10;    Y --&gt; Z2[Loki]&#10;    Y --&gt; Z3[Dynatrace]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Claude Code] --&gt; X[OTLP HTTP/gRPC]\n    B[Codex CLI] --&gt; X\n    C[Gemini CLI] --&gt; X\n    X --&gt; Y[OTel Collector]\n    Y --&gt; Z1[Prometheus]\n    Y --&gt; Z2[Loki]\n    Y --&gt; Z3[Dynatrace]</pre><p>三家配置维度横向对比见下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Claude Code</th>\n<th>Codex CLI</th>\n<th>Gemini CLI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启用 env var</td>\n<td><code>CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY=1</code></td>\n<td><code>CODEX_TELEMETRY=1</code></td>\n<td><code>GEMINI_TELEMETRY=1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认 exporter</td>\n<td>console</td>\n<td>console</td>\n<td>Cloud Operations</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Admin 中央化</td>\n<td>managed-settings.json</td>\n<td>cloud config</td>\n<td>gcloud config</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloud auto export</td>\n<td>否（self-managed）</td>\n<td>是（Anthropic-managed）</td>\n<td>是（GCP-managed）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dashboard 预配</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Dynatrace 模板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"claude-code-配置\">Claude Code 配置</h2><p>Claude Code 的 OTel 启用最小命令。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"export CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY=1&#10;export OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER=otlp&#10;export OTEL_LOGS_EXPORTER=otlp&#10;export OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL=http/protobuf&#10;export OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://collector.internal:4318\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">otlp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTEL_LOGS_EXPORTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">otlp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">http/protobuf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">http://collector.internal:4318</span></span></code></pre></div><p>可选 exporter 三种：<code>console</code>（stdout 调试）、<code>otlp</code>（生产 OTLP HTTP/gRPC）、<code>prometheus</code>（pull-based 暴露 metric 端口）。</p>\n<p>Admin 中央化通过 <code>managed-settings.json</code>——放在 <code>/etc/claude/managed-settings.json</code> 或 macOS <code>/Library/Application Support/Claude/</code>，全 org 用户共享配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;env&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,&#10;    &quot;OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT&quot;: &quot;http://collector.internal:4318&quot;,&#10;    &quot;OTEL_LOG_USER_PROMPTS&quot;: &quot;0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS&quot;: &quot;0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;permissions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;deny&quot;: [&quot;mcp__filesystem__delete&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://collector.internal:4318\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"OTEL_LOG_USER_PROMPTS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"permissions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mcp__filesystem__delete\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>中央化的核心好处：<strong>dev 自己改 env var 也覆盖不了</strong>——managed-settings 优先级最高。SRE 一处配好，全 org 一致；避免出现&quot;老王把 endpoint 配错导致他那条 metric 丢了&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"codex-cli-配置\">Codex CLI 配置</h2><p>Codex 的 OTel 启用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"export CODEX_TELEMETRY=1&#10;export OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://collector.internal:4318\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CODEX_TELEMETRY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">http://collector.internal:4318</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Codex 的设计哲学是 <strong>跨 surface unified</strong>——CLI、IDE plugin、ChatGPT app、Codex Cloud 共享同一份 telemetry pipeline。在 Cloud 模式（agent 跑在 OpenAI 数据中心）时，Anthropic-managed exporter 自动 push 到你绑定的 backend；本地装机要手动配 OTLP endpoint。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    CLI[Codex CLI] --&gt; P[OTel pipeline]&#10;    IDE[Codex IDE] --&gt; P&#10;    APP[ChatGPT app] --&gt; P&#10;    CLOUD[Codex Cloud] --&gt; P&#10;    P --&gt; E[OTLP exporter]&#10;    E --&gt; B[customer backend]\">flowchart TB\n    CLI[Codex CLI] --&gt; P[OTel pipeline]\n    IDE[Codex IDE] --&gt; P\n    APP[ChatGPT app] --&gt; P\n    CLOUD[Codex Cloud] --&gt; P\n    P --&gt; E[OTLP exporter]\n    E --&gt; B[customer backend]</pre><p>跨 surface 的好处：在同一个 dashboard 里能同时看到 dev 用 CLI、PM 用 ChatGPT app、CI 用 Codex Cloud 三类活动；同一个 user.email 把三个 surface 串成一个用户视图。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Surface</th>\n<th>OTel 内置</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>是（v0.50+）</td>\n<td>env var 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDE plugin</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>继承 IDE 全局设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChatGPT app</td>\n<td>是（v2026.4+）</td>\n<td>跟随登录 org 设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Codex Cloud</td>\n<td>是（默认开）</td>\n<td>org-level dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gemini-cli-配置\">Gemini CLI 配置</h2><p>Gemini 的特殊在于&quot;开箱即用&quot;——内置 OTel + 与 Google Cloud Operations 默认集成 + 预配 Dynatrace dashboard 模板。</p>\n<p>最小启用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"export GEMINI_TELEMETRY=1&#10;# 默认 export 到 gcloud project 当前用户的 Cloud Operations&#10;gcloud config set project my-team-2026\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GEMINI_TELEMETRY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 默认 export 到 gcloud project 当前用户的 Cloud Operations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcloud</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> project</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-team-2026</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Cloud Operations 集成意味着：trace、metric、log 三信号直接出现在 GCP console；无需另装 Collector。对小团队特别友好——5 分钟就能看到 dashboard。</p>\n<p>如果走 on-prem 自托管，标准 OTLP 配置即可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"export GEMINI_TELEMETRY=1&#10;export OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://collector.internal:4318&#10;unset GEMINI_USE_CLOUD_OPERATIONS  # 显式关掉默认 GCP 集成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GEMINI_TELEMETRY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">http://collector.internal:4318</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GEMINI_USE_CLOUD_OPERATIONS</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 显式关掉默认 GCP 集成</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Dynatrace 与 Gemini 的合作在 2026 推出了一套 <strong>AI coding agent monitoring 模板</strong>——一键导入后自动出现五张 dashboard：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Token consumption by user</li>\n<li>Tool usage heatmap</li>\n<li>Cost burn-down</li>\n<li>Error rate by model</li>\n<li>Session duration distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套模板是 2026 年 SRE 圈最常被复制的&quot;开箱可观测&quot;基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨工具-unified-export-pattern\">跨工具 unified export pattern</h2><p>三家 CLI 都遵循 OTel 标准 OTLP 协议，意味着可以让它们共享同一份 OTel Collector，最终落到同一份 backend。这是 platform 团队 2026 年最常采用的部署模式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Claude] --&gt; C[OTel Collector]&#10;    B[Codex] --&gt; C&#10;    G[Gemini] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; P[Prometheus]&#10;    C --&gt; L[Loki]&#10;    C --&gt; T[Tempo]&#10;    P --&gt; D[Grafana dashboard]&#10;    L --&gt; D&#10;    T --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    A[Claude] --&gt; C[OTel Collector]\n    B[Codex] --&gt; C\n    G[Gemini] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; P[Prometheus]\n    C --&gt; L[Loki]\n    C --&gt; T[Tempo]\n    P --&gt; D[Grafana dashboard]\n    L --&gt; D\n    T --&gt; D</pre><p>关键好处：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>好处</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>统一 dashboard</td>\n<td>SRE 一张图看完三家代理活动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单一 cost 视角</td>\n<td>三家 token cost 在同一表里横向比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不必维护三套监控</td>\n<td>Collector 一套配置受益所有 CLI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨工具 user view</td>\n<td>同一 user.email 在三家串起来看</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最小 docker-compose Collector 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"version: &#39;3&#39;&#10;services:&#10;  otel-collector:&#10;    image: otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.106.0&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;4317:4317&#39;&#10;      - &#39;4318:4318&#39;&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./otel-config.yaml:/etc/otel-config.yaml&#10;    command: [&#39;--config=/etc/otel-config.yaml&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otel-collector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.106.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4317:4317'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4318:4318'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./otel-config.yaml:/etc/otel-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--config=/etc/otel-config.yaml'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>otel-config.yaml</code> 关键骨架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"receivers:&#10;  otlp:&#10;    protocols:&#10;      http: { endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318 }&#10;      grpc: { endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317 }&#10;processors:&#10;  batch: {}&#10;exporters:&#10;  prometheus:&#10;    endpoint: 0.0.0.0:9090&#10;  loki:&#10;    endpoint: http://loki:3100/loki/api/v1/push&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    metrics:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [batch]&#10;      exporters: [prometheus]&#10;    logs:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [batch]&#10;      exporters: [loki]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocols</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4318</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      grpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4317</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:9090</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  loki</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://loki:3100/loki/api/v1/push</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">loki</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三家 env var 名字不同</strong>：Claude 是 <code>CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY</code>、Codex 是 <code>CODEX_TELEMETRY</code>、Gemini 是 <code>GEMINI_TELEMETRY</code>；写脚本要分别 export</li>\n<li><strong>Gemini 没显式 unset Cloud Operations</strong>：on-prem 自托管时 telemetry 同时进 GCP 与本地 Collector，cost 翻倍</li>\n<li><strong>managed-settings.json 与 user settings 优先级搞反</strong>：managed &gt; user，dev 改不掉的项要确认在 managed 文件里</li>\n<li><strong>Collector 没配资源 limit</strong>：高并发时 OOM；生产必须设 memory_limiter processor</li>\n<li><strong>Codex Cloud auto-export 与 on-prem 双开</strong>：同一事件被记两次；选一种导出路径</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三家都走 opt-in env var + OTLP exporter 两层</li>\n<li>Claude 中央化用 <code>managed-settings.json</code>、Codex 用 cloud config、Gemini 用 gcloud</li>\n<li>Gemini 默认与 GCP Cloud Operations 集成、附 Dynatrace dashboard 模板</li>\n<li>跨工具 unified pattern：三家共享一份 OTel Collector，统一 dashboard 看所有代理</li>\n<li>Docker-compose Collector + Prometheus + Loki 是 2026 最小可观测 stack</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Backend 选型决策见 <a href=\"../backends-and-session-search/backend-comparison\"><code>../2_backends-and-session-search/1_backend-comparison.md</code></a>。协议本身的字段含义参考 <a href=\"otel-and-stream-json-protocols\"><code>./1_otel-and-stream-json-protocols.md</code></a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三家 CLI 的 OTel export 配置","id":"三家-cli-的-otel-export-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Claude Code 配置","id":"claude-code-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Codex CLI 配置","id":"codex-cli-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Gemini CLI 配置","id":"gemini-cli-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"跨工具 unified export pattern","id":"跨工具-unified-export-pattern"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OTel 协议本体与 stream-json wrapper 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/observability/otel-fundamentals/otel-and-stream-json-protocols"},"next":{"title":"Backend 横向比较与典型部署组合","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/observability/backends-and-session-search/backend-comparison"}}